    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\">The Orchard Apple Maturity Dataset is a collection of images taken in real orchards to help train computer vision models for smart agriculture. It features four distinct classes based on the fruit's development stage: Young apple, Pre-growth apple, Ripe apple, and Late-growth apple, all captured under realistic conditions with varied lighting and backgrounds. This dataset is ideal for tasks like automated harvesting, yield prediction, and object detection by classifying the ripeness of apples directly on the tree.</p>",
